# --- OpenTofu / Terraform ---
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
# Variable files may carry environment-specific values; ours carry no secrets
# (constitution: zero stored secrets), but they are per-machine, not source.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
# Override files are local experiments by definition
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT ignored — committed lockfiles are
# the version-pin mechanism (FR-006); provider bumps must appear as PR diffs.

# --- .NET ---
bin/
obj/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

# --- Universal ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
*.log
.env
.env.*
